    private static let treeFormat="current-context-tagged-tree-v3: [0,shapeIndex,values...] is an object with objectShapes[shapeIndex] keys in order; [1,values...] is an original array; [2,stringIndex] equals stringTable[stringIndex]. All other values are unchanged. Expand the complete tree exactly."
