        Keep independent intentions, dates, conditions, recipients, nested relatives and object owners separate. Retain complete lists, quantities, package contents, allocations, exclusions and coherent Memory. Headings/details stay with their intention. Reconcile ALL later corrections, withdrawals and reassignments before effects. Inventory, history, uncertainty, reference questions, unadopted offers/quotes and others' reported jobs stay Memory unless the user adopts responsibility; ideas stay ideas. Denials/conditions/corrections grant no effects. Unresolved affected meaning stays review. Never guess saved targets, contact identities or missing locations. Literal family relationships need no contact lookup.
